      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Hi, thanks for your report.\n\nPlease can you give specific steps for how to reproduce this issue in an avatar project? I can see a similar effect by adding both a VRChat constraint component and a physbone component to the same game object and then entering play mode. Does this match your case?\n\nYou've cited this as an SDK specific issue that started in 2025.1.1, but there was no SDK release alongside this client release - our most recent SDK release at this time is 3.7.5, which was released on December 11th 2024. Can you please confirm which SDK version you're seeing this issue in?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
