      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name}\n\nThis issue definitely started occurring with the latest update. (To clarify, I mean that this problem arises specifically in the latest SDK and the latest VRChat release.)\n\nAs you mentioned, the issue occurs when both a Constraint component and a PhysBone component are present on the same GameObject. This was not an issue in previous versions.\n\nWith this update, gimmicks that previously worked without problems on avatar clothing containing Constraints are now bugged and no longer function correctly.\n\nYou can see clothing with Constraint functionality in this link(https://x.com/SOLSTICE_VR/status/1865793628406431930).\n\nCurrently, this functionality is not working due to a bug.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
