      "value": "I'm having a similar issue.\n\nMy setup is a physbone chain (a tail) and I have added a parent constraint to one of the final links. My idea is to animate it so a toggle makes the tail jump to the position of the armature wrist, so it can be waved around with my hands.\n\nThe result, both in Unity and in VRChat, is that the bone moves to the parent position, but the physbone chain does not react, and the geometry deforms (crude pic included: pink are physbones (root is leftmost), white is constrained bone, blue is mesh).\n\nI have tried moving the constraint script to a different game object, just in case, but keeps behaving the same.\n\nPosition and rotation constraints behave in the same way.\n\nThanks!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
